.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a concrete implementation of \fBIModelPromp<T>\fP used to encapsulate model input, contextual metadata, session information, execution parameters, and optional tags\&. 

\fBModelPromp<T>\fP is the standard prompt container used by all IModelBackend implementations\&. It provides a mutable structure for building and enriching prompts before they are passed into the model pipeline, while also supporting functional-style cloning through the \fRWith*\fP methods\&. 

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The underlying prompt type (e\&.g\&., text, tokens, binary data, AST, etc\&.)\&. 
.RE
.PP

